      }
    },
    "387": {
      "date": "2026-11-17",
      "edition": "Tuesday 17 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Captain's milestone",
          "heading": "Antoine Dupont turns 30 two days after his 'masterclass' against South Africa",
          "body": "The France captain hit the milestone on Sunday, two days after the 21-19 defeat of the Springboks at the Stade de France, in which, says Midi Olympique journalist Jérôme Prévôt, he delivered a \"masterclass.\" Prévôt traces his career back to Castres, where Dupont made his professional debut against Leinster in the European Cup on 26 October 2014, aged 17 and needing a dispensation to play against adults. Then-France coach Guy Novès gave him his Test debut in Italy during the 2017 Six Nations."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "New Zealand's Quinn Tupaea needs thumb surgery, out 10 weeks",
          "body": "Ireland's Jamie Osborne ruled out with pectoral injury."
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "name": "Rugbyrama"
      }
    },
    "388": {
      "date": "2026-11-17",
      "edition": "Tuesday 17 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Injury bulletin",
          "heading": "Dan Sheehan to return to full training as Jamie Osborne ruled out",
          "body": "Centre Osborne's pectoral injury, sustained early against Fiji, is one of three fresh Ireland casualties. Debutant replacement No. 8 James McNabney is unavailable while on a 12-day return-to-play protocol, and replacement tighthead Sam Illo enters the concussion process. Hooker Sheehan, named captain for this month's matches, missed that 43-15 win after a concussion against Argentina but is in line to face South Africa on Saturday. Fans in the app were happy with the Fiji result: of the 42 who answered, 69% were buzzing."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "New Zealand's Quinn Tupaea needs thumb surgery, out 10 weeks",
          "body": ""
        }
      ],
